{
  "5": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:e9bd7ea5e93f0143a90b77c27ac808501838b708381c4d8772aeb896f51c041b",
      "text": "M-Mister Ghost~? A-are you\nin here~?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "9": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:e9b8d20d8e2496e46deb06858e86005973bceef24a845928785231d61d7f8545",
      "text": "A g-ghost's voice...?!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "14": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:3f7b1ef73b790ee60ab8f5e9a1a86c69d799bd007f8aa4aa0c9bc283fe68e38e",
      "text": "Ugh... Fei, Shan... Your big\nsister's going to do her best...!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "19": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:bd6bf6f040bd698771be60a79f3d13f0d866b5c46ddb005bb1666775557af5ad",
      "text": "Ha, easy. They're shining all over\nthe place, so I can see them\nperfectly!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "25": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:59ea807fc3b9081175fe3ba250a15726812b22f6dd3e68d9fd95b16d5cf6c8e8",
      "text": "HIYAAAAAAAAAAH!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "29": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:6bb0b3f4089fdd62194274dbf2ccae40b6fa4161fcdbc40d39f3c47028e706da",
      "text": "RAAAAAAAAAAAAAH~~~!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "34": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:b4da9211d2a477805cc88cda419123db61d8e4480dcaa613aa17f4df5fd259e8",
      "text": "Whoa, who are you?!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "38": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:54cf40577469483325fd325ef282d0622d4ace57224d7708939163f964e54adb",
      "text": "H-hey, calm down!?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "43": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:173a207082d7a4ee841093aac22e11ee2b9eeaa83885c2c1b027b02c23cd5774",
      "text": "Huh... people...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "47": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:e27302d3074c21b970b594cc6ea4a7eb0393e5d2d93debcb661e81400e0807e2",
      "text": "I-it's all right! Chenxi the Ghost\nHunter is here, so there's nothing\nto fear anymore!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "54": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a5fcddb5318f8688ace663fa7cca440fb4c6b4afd82a88e2d0feb6091542ccd0",
      "text": "What?! Hunting glowing monsters?!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "58": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:5ed12fad2e16665f7b5e939badf941473a9cdcf820b499f81ed32a0ba1f4d232",
      "text": "Yes. We took a request that there's\na nest in this abandoned Float.\nFishing boats are being lured astray.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "63": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:c55ade67069ac475c5c416c885845dc05210d83a738f8aae0a0ad2d62c32f30a",
      "text": "Oh, so it's monsters~!\nThank goodness~~~...!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "68": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:2f47012221abb9375ebcc507032cdbc2d49ff2e25fe417f536fa4bb5745a1d9a",
      "text": "Huh? Didn't you take a similar\nrequest, too?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "72": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f47792409d1f04d8e6587a5f23cc19862f80cfa236c1a0b3e74aa8dec32f6165",
      "text": "W-well, yes, but... I was told I'd\nbe facing a ghost.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "77": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:52613ffd2bff7a280482e54aefb84b9a04b2cff26a86676775a0cca80c26455d",
      "text": "Oh, you mentioned it earlier.\nGhost Hunter, right?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "82": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f4a30f7f27564ee24faaf7f1453b8ba352715e7ad621f7ccff18a4c0e8a323ac",
      "text": "Yet you looked terrified earlier...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "86": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:19a5f1b35eedf479307357fc08e05a084caec38cd408351abf518aeb2b40b490",
      "text": "Urk...! Actually... yes...\nI'm scared of ghosts...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "90": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a2f8a55e20f0495f25322cfcd4a003792cfa7830dad637e6c2f9a7849cd6f426",
      "text": "Isn't that... kind of the worst\njob you could pick...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "95": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:e7eebcad3ecd5d9b311058fb23d95cb95c3b230284196e5f760049fe418af415",
      "text": "B-but I'm really good at qigong...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "98": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a0bb08ba406aa8b5f23e461ce70063c931e1ef056dcc8e99f80d5b62c78f4900",
      "text": "It's a classic, isn't it? Qigong\nis how you deal with ghosts.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "103": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:77caf2e3467a920b14d4829738c02867c4cffdaee2e450083f1f38ade25ed474",
      "text": "Uh, never heard of it...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "108": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:6d115078c12cb270d5091ced60cfc0fdb37d759efbd0d3ee1445d27afbcc2c82",
      "text": "So that's what they say around\nhere.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "113": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:8ddef4e7451b64acca5cf002568949fe3510becde7602cdcb8afbb6730dca210",
      "text": "Still, if that is the case, our\nquarry this time is monsters. You\nneedn't fight at all.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "118": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:ff2a09e22970d376d08cd66670c8830363b2a1993537044bbc03885265ddd2e4",
      "text": "Huh... Then what about you all?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "122": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:4454722724a087d3fa0449509db7b959cb99c85b653637cabe4dfb8305e9d908",
      "text": "Our request was to exterminate\nmonsters. We'll press on and\ndeal with the rest.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "127": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a3cefc791729474a35d529d4b6805abd24b736a39e6fcc2f7df10373d89e68e3",
      "text": "...Then please let me come along!\nGetting rid of what scares people\nis a Ghost Hunter's job too!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "132": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:9568b4b154777b4e436607076422046f7b7e91032a62c7aa1c92e81247d909f4",
      "text": "Okay. Nice to meet you, Chenxi.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "137": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a6e632ba11b8d6f4593bb43378ca63c46e42c598ac78eba403fedb26c0062ef5",
      "text": "Likewise!! As long as it's not\na ghost, bring it on!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "143": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:04f25bfd7807b298c866c545e0ae2b9585a20b4a1a28da9b28ac62cbc524684e",
      "text": "EEEEEEEEEEEEEK!?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "148": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:619676c2a708c9ccb81ba08e027ecc583245bbbbab096b943c775fdc909a4b62",
      "text": "Come on, you're scared stiff\nanyway.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "152": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f957da2b0d2da17770968496e7486b6791d7f1d9d5c789ef0535f2c78d7421ec",
      "text": "B-but...! When I think a ghost\nmight jump out of the dark...!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "155": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:4e22e9dc72606ff0475d498b7e0cfa4c1e3dac3dc9de306b63397af4994ed347",
      "text": "Thanks a lot, Chenxi! Now everyone\nin town can sleep soundly!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "158": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:c273b21e54478d28a853737419c99f3b2f4a543fcaae6525983b0f4f52289ef0",
      "text": "U-um, well, actually...\nthis time it wasn't a ghost—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "161": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:8630e89f99ab392422f8a38af53d6a452bbdb0fff063c95acc70ed4ddc66da29",
      "text": "Hahaha, modest as ever! Here's\nyour pay. Go treat those little\nones to something tasty!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "165": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:88f6715ce10a4ae5c7421f95be52e2a2a7bb37ea2a79175edaf22786d5598ead",
      "text": "Oh, wait! Ugh...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "169": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:b94eb0a4f6e56238724f6d446d8e5ced644e6af8b86418e7004f1f656d60f9b6",
      "text": "Just take it. You did take\nthem out, after all.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "173": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a545c23f6399c1ef0827e838de2797877ba35613f4152d9b493752fce2062c56",
      "text": "Y-you're right. Then let's\nsplit it between us—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "178": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:ad12d03149d172c4387c7aaf316f3034d64e9e3fcb445531398935ba3ca4796d",
      "text": "Nah, it's fine. We get paid\nfor our own job.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "183": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a4375f5cf9e5eca9f2e2d7fbf27baf9c0a460e0446701f0e82c2525610dd7130",
      "text": "Th-thank you so much...!! We're\npoor at home, so this really\nhelps!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "188": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:1c369538029e081553543fa25752ff4f865d4c4bb9afb2f6c8fdef5236cc0643",
      "text": "Heh. For your family, then...\nAn admirable resolve.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "192": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:2b894cec380a572f944e2b6adecc6a0c5d1dd87f7128e271d0323ee3a7276433",
      "text": "I-it's nothing so grand! I just try\nmy best at what I can do...\nThat's all.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "196": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:b3a239174ce77af5cea1228495e0c913fa9ad4ef16e3f4c3956ff481949b5ae3",
      "text": "...Though being such a scaredy-cat,\nI mess up a lot...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "199": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:d79c845e4e16f5f17e6c93763de000cfe60db8d353fb442c3c2f362fa1936176",
      "text": "Do any of you know something...?\nLike... a good way to get used to\nscary things...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "203": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:baaafa088932b20c1de3112d134b0d1f3e6d195a1c47186d050c26598fedf5de",
      "text": "...Hmm. Well... I don't know if\nyou'll get used to it, but—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "210": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a5dbc9d820b624f228950fd83fc56723838d6d5495b1fb2b9a9f54aa7d16af92",
      "text": "EEEEEEEEEEEEK!?!?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "216": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:c622005000cf7c3cff971b34289faf1e029f2e701bd16303a9274ab67da16a79",
      "text": "G-gh-ghosts, so many...!?\nEeeeeeek...!?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "220": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:ceec6e0403b2cffe38bfd7d6c3a0e855563a30418e1560eca6ecd27bcd5dffaa",
      "text": "They're not ghosts, they're yokai.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "225": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:4569a7d91af0d2d4563dec02f7822f7a869f96e3db3aa333204284b6a9316961",
      "text": "How about it? I hope this helps you\nget used to them a bit...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "230": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:5960baf54ff591b8cadbf7bf129ed95de23f1cea436d07e7fec8ced5a7a038eb",
      "text": "Y-yes, very much!\nThank you so much!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "233": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:fc1e6a885177bc70e83277480df3afbd18b6c252f0d54553ad4c2bbffb74651c",
      "text": "...Wait for me, Fei, Shan. Your\nbig sister will learn to hunt\nghosts without being scared!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "236": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:4a820b34a9f9fdc2961b2fe28b08f65907d552ac662728aabec0fc4aac679b9e",
      "text": "Boo-oo-oo.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "241": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:ac46ce5349327616419930ad2c44e382b65af82bf7e43e6468b387f838d43c7a",
      "text": "WAAAAAAAAAAAH!?!?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  }
}
